0..64 Comment "//! Two substitution composites act alike under index agreement."
65..68 Comment "//!"
69..147 Comment "//! An abstraction unfolds both composites by conversion. `substTwiceUnderLam`"
148..224 Comment "//! states that step. `lift-as-definition.gandr` states it with lifting as a"
225..240 Comment "//! definition."
241..244 Comment "//!"
245..318 Comment "//! A lifted lookup is a weakened lookup. `substWeaken` moves a weak term"
319..393 Comment "//! through a lifted substitution. The proof weakens the index hypothesis."
394..397 Comment "//!"
398..413 Comment "//! - see: #640"
415..481 Comment "// This source imports syntax and lemmas for lifted substitutions."
